[
    {
        "content": "<p>The following fails because Lean picks up the wrong <code>Encodable</code> instance for the rationals:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Data</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Rat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Denumerable</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℚ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Denumerable</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ofNat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℚ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Encodable</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">encode</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Denumerable</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ofNat_encode</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Is there a way to prevent this problem? Why don't other Denumerable types have a similar issue?</p>",
        "id": 578540681,
        "sender_full_name": "Matt Diamond",
        "timestamp": 1773201388
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The root cause of this is that Mathlib has two instances to encode <code>Rat</code>(<code>ℚ</code>).<br>\nWe should make one of them a non-instance.</p>",
        "id": 578552644,
        "sender_full_name": "Miyahara Kō",
        "timestamp": 1773208838
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Temporal fix for you:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">attribute</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Rat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">instEncodable</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 578553338,
        "sender_full_name": "Miyahara Kō",
        "timestamp": 1773209116
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I think <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Denumerable.ofEncodableOfInfinite#doc\">docs#Denumerable.ofEncodableOfInfinite</a> is to blame here</p>",
        "id": 578555348,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1773210080
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I think that the not temporal solution in this case is to remove <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Rat.instDenumerable#doc\">docs#Rat.instDenumerable</a>, and use <code>WithDenumerable ℚ</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">module</span>\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Logic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Denumerable</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">expose</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">section</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">WithDenumerable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">val</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">WithDenumerable</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"bp\">*</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">simps</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">equiv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">WithDenumerable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">toFun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">val</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">invFun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mk</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Infinite</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Infinite</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">WithDenumerable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">equiv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">infinite_iff</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mpr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inferInstance</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Infinite</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Encodable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Denumerable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">WithDenumerable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">letI</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Encodable</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ofEquiv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">equiv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Denumerable</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ofEncodableOfInfinite</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">WithDenumerable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">WithDenumerable</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 578558806,
        "sender_full_name": "Miyahara Kō",
        "timestamp": 1773211685
    },
